    [CI][BugFix] Forward test paths to A3-560T nightly jobs (#19359)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Forward `matrix.test_config.tests` to the A3-560T single-node reusable
    workflow. Directory-based jobs otherwise reach `Validate Inputs` with
    both `tests` and `config_file_path` empty and stop before pytest.
    
    This isolates the one-line scheduler fix already included in #18431 so
    it can be merged first and unblock that PR's A3 nightly validation.
    Reproduced in [this nightly
    job](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/39557639190/job/119082967326).
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. CI workflow fix only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Parsed the caller and callee YAML and verified that the callee accepts
    `tests`.
    - Checked parameter resolution for directory jobs (reproduces the
    failure before the fix), existing YAML jobs, and empty inputs.
    - `git diff --check` passed. No NPU tests or nightly runs were
    triggered.
    - Full repository lint was attempted but could not complete: actionlint
    hook initialization stalled while fetching its dependency. Focused YAML
    checks passed; full lint remains for CI.
    
    ### Checklist
    
    - [x] Reviewed directory, YAML and empty-input cases with focused static
    checks.
    - [ ] A3 nightly execution after the scheduler fix is merged.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: Foriv <2293567056@qq.com>

